### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5090
@missingId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 1. Create room (expected: 201 + Location)
# @name createRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study room 1",
  "capacity": 10
}

###
@roomId = {{createRoom.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Create room with empty name - R1 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "capacity": 10
}

### 3. Create room with capacity 0 - R1 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study room 2",
  "capacity": 0
}

### 4. Get room (expected: 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}

### 5. Get a missing room (expected: 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{missingId}}

### 6. Create booking 10:00-12:00 (expected: 201 + Location)
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

###
@bookingId = {{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. Create booking on a missing room, even with an invalid body (expected: 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{missingId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 0
}

### 8. bookedBy empty - R2 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": " ",
  "startUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-02-01T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 9. End equal to start - R3 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 10. Attendees 0 - R4 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-02-01T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 0
}

### 11. Attendees above capacity - R4 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-02-01T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 11
}

### 12. Booking in the past - R5 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2020-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2020-01-10T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 13. Booking of 5 hours - R6 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-03-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-03-01T15:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 14. Booking of exactly 4 hours - R6 (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-03-02T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-03-02T14:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 15. Booking that only touches 10:00-12:00 - R7 (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "bogdan",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T13:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 16. Overlapping booking 11:00-13:00 - R7 (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "bogdan",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T11:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T13:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 17. Get booking (expected: 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### 18. Get a missing booking (expected: 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{missingId}}

### 19. Cancel booking - R8 (expected: 204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 20. Cancel the same booking again - R8 (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 21. Cancel a missing booking - R8 (expected: 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{missingId}}/cancel

### 22. Book the freed interval 10:00-12:00 again - R8 (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "carmen",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 23. Invalid JSON (expected: 400 application/problem+json)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ bad json

### 24. Persistence: restart the application, then run this (expected: 200, status Cancelled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
